cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: "The last missing splitting patterns in two theta fields"
abstract: "Certified prime chains below 2^1585 put the last missed starts at 14493/4 for nine trace pairs and 26211/4 for sixteen quadratic sign patterns in intervals (L,4L/3]. A finite table gives all missed starts in that range for every factor at least 4/3. Under Dirichlet GRH these thresholds hold at all heights and the prime weight admits explicit bounds in shrinking intervals."
